  "description": "The Vinyl LTD has fine handling and great looks. Built around a welded steel frame and a Cromoly steel fork. Featuring a pizza front rack forming a 240mm by 315mm platform to carry luggage. Equipped with reliable components including a flip flop hub with cog and freewheel, Michelin tyres,and F&R Caliper brakes. Stylish touches such as deep profile track rims, a black chain and crank, sealed bearing hubs and rise bar. Removable cable guides mean that the frame remains totally clean and uninterrupted in brakeless mode. Available in matte XBlack and Off White.",
